{
 "total": 39.868,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 2.496,
   "texto": "Your patio is pouring the rain right into your house!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 2.616,
   "b": 5.095,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. Flo made hers perfectly flat!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 5.215,
   "b": 8.231,
   "texto": "Flat is level. Level is good. Everybody knows that!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 8.351,
   "b": 12.092,
   "texto": "Flat means the water has nowhere to go. It sits there, or runs to the wall.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 12.212,
   "b": 16.051,
   "texto": "Puddles by the door, water against the foundation, and soon a wet basement.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 16.171,
   "b": 17.73,
   "texto": "So it's supposed to be crooked?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 17.85,
   "b": 19.987,
   "texto": "Not crooked. Sloped. Away from the house.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 20.107,
   "b": 24.317,
   "texto": "About a quarter inch per foot. A ten foot patio drops about two and a half inches.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 24.437,
   "b": 27.617,
   "texto": "Put a four foot level on it. The low end should sit about an inch lower.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 27.737,
   "b": 29.149,
   "texto": "Won't my chairs slide off?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 29.269,
   "b": 31.528,
   "texto": "Nope. You'll never feel it. But the rain will.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 31.648,
   "b": 34.304,
   "texto": "Fine. A tiny tilt. I can live with that.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 34.424,
   "b": 37.626,
   "texto": "Perfectly flat, or sloped away? Team Norm or Team Flo?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 37.746,
   "b": 39.868,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
